  "borough": "Royal Borough of Kingston (LA Code)",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Due to its layout, the proposed Flat 01 would not provide adequate levels of daylight and outlook to the habitable room, being the living and dining area. No Daylight Assessment has been submitted in support of the proposal. Furthermore, the proposed floor-to-ceiling height for the proposed Flat 02 is contrary to Policy D6. As such, it is considered that the proposal would fail to provide an adequate standard of accommodation for future occupiers, contrary to Policy D6 of the London Plan 2021 and Policy DM10 of the Core Strategy 2012."
  ],
